{"module":"mcq","item":{"id":"a2-fill-modal","level":"A2","title":{"de":"Modalverben üben","bn":"মোডাল ক্রিয়া অনুশীলন","en":"Practise modal verbs"},"skill":"grammar","difficulty":2,"questions":[{"id":"a2-f-1","type":"fill","prompt":"Ich ___ gut schwimmen. (können)","promptBn":"আমি ভালো সাঁতার কাটতে পারি।","accept":["kann"],"explanation":"ich → kann"},{"id":"a2-f-2","type":"fill","prompt":"Du ___ mehr Wasser trinken. (müssen)","promptBn":"তোমাকে আরও পানি খেতে হবে।","accept":["musst"],"explanation":"du → musst"},{"id":"a2-f-3","type":"fill","prompt":"Er ___ Arzt werden. (wollen)","promptBn":"সে ডাক্তার হতে চায়।","accept":["will"],"explanation":"er → will"},{"id":"a2-f-4","type":"fill","prompt":"Hier ___ man nicht parken. (dürfen)","promptBn":"এখানে গাড়ি রাখা নিষেধ।","accept":["darf"],"explanation":"man → darf („man“ সবসময় er/sie/es-এর মতো)"},{"id":"a2-f-5","type":"fill","prompt":"___ Sie einen Tee? (möchten)","promptBn":"আপনি কি চা নেবেন?","accept":["Möchten","möchten"],"explanation":"Sie → möchten; হ্যাঁ/না প্রশ্নে ক্রিয়া প্রথমে।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-fill-modal","level":"A2","test":[]}